Sign-in errors written for the person reading them. The sign-in screen raises alerts saying the iOS build does not have Sign in with Apple enabled yet, and that Google sign-in for Android still needs EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID in the app environment. Both name build configuration to somebody who has none, on the first screen a reviewer sees, and both read as an unfinished app. Say what the person can do instead and keep the diagnostic in a development-only log.